{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15939","headline":"幽州送申稷评事归平卢 · 王建","name":"幽州送申稷评事归平卢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行子绕天北，山高塞复深。\n升堂展客礼，临水濯缨襟。\n驱驰戎地马，聚散林间禽。\n一杯泻东流，各愿无异心。\n蓟亭虽苦寒，春夕勿重衾。\n从军任白头，莫卖故山岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}